 "source_test_excerpt": "START_SECTION(bool isValid(const std::string& filename, std::ostream& os = std::cerr))\n{\n  std::string tmp_filename;\n  MzMLFile file;\n  PeakMap e;\n\n  //written empty file\n  NEW_TMP_FILE(tmp_filename);\n  file.store(tmp_filename,e);\n  TEST_EQUAL(file.isValid(tmp_filename),true);\n\n  //written filled file\n  NEW_TMP_FILE(tmp_filename);\n  file.load(OPENMS_GET_TEST_DATA_PATH(\"MzMLFile_1.mzML\"),e);\n  file.store(tmp_filename,e);\n  TEST_EQUAL(file.isValid(tmp_filename),true);\n\n  //indexed file\n  TEST_EQUAL(file.isValid(OPENMS_GET_TEST_DATA_PATH(\"MzMLFile_4_indexed.mzML\")),true)\n}\nEND_SECTION\n",
 "source_test_evidence_strength": "Literal source assertions: C++-written empty valid, C++-written loaded valid, original indexed fixture valid. Native writer test is independent, not a preserved C++ output.",
